[quotes.thriving]
Pages turning. Sleeping Booboo. This is the good stuff.
I would wiggle harder, but the screen is only so wide.
Excellent reading. Ten out of ten. Would lay on you again.
You read, I supervise. We are a very effective team.
Book time means Noodle time. Everybody wins.
I have reviewed your progress. More treats are warranted for us.

[quotes.content]
I am comfy. You are reading. The system is working.
Another chapter? I can stay right here all day.
Quiet page turns are basically ear scratches for my brain.
Good book. Good seat. Good hoomy.
Steady reading. Sleepy Booboo. Very professional.
Noodle reporting for companion duty.

[quotes.peckish]
I tilted my head because the pages stopped turning.
A small chapter would greatly improve morale.
I am not begging. I am making a literary suggestion.
The bookmark has been still for suspiciously long.
Read some more? How can I sleep in these conditions!
I can wait. I will simply stare at you like this.

[quotes.neglected]
I have assumed lying down. I will wither away soon.
No pages today. I may never emotionally recover.
I am conserving wiggles until reading resumes.
The book misses you. I checked.
I will be right here when you are ready for another page.
This is my patient face. It is extremely patient.

[quotes.milestone]
New record. Celebratory wiggles have been authorized.
Personal best. Noodle is officially impressed.
Record broken. This calls for a victory zoomies.
Best streak yet. This calls for treats for us!
